1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,280
(Josh:)Amazing.

2
00:00:02,277 --> 00:00:03,807
(Guy:)I know.

3
00:00:03,812 --> 00:00:05,142
(Sheldon:)This isn't the printout.

4
00:00:05,146 --> 00:00:07,116
(Sheldon:)This is my real face.

5
00:00:08,148 --> 00:00:09,778
(Amy:)What are we doing?

6
00:00:09,784 --> 00:00:11,114
(Amy:)This is a fort.

7
00:00:11,119 --> 00:00:13,449
(Amy:)Let's sit on the floor.

8
00:00:13,454 --> 00:00:15,524
(Sheldon:)Roughing it? Okay.

9
00:00:17,958 --> 00:00:19,388
(gasps)

10
00:00:19,394 --> 00:00:22,464
(Sheldon:)Everything looks
so big from down here.

11
00:00:24,064 --> 00:00:27,064
(Sheldon:)This must be
how Leonard feels.

12
00:00:30,504 --> 00:00:32,274
(Howard:)I'm surprised
you could hear me

13
00:00:32,273 --> 00:00:34,073
(Howard:)with this Thin Mint
in your ear!

14
00:00:34,075 --> 00:00:35,575
(laughs)

15
00:00:35,577 --> 00:00:37,177
(Howard:)Yeah, pretty cool, huh?

16
00:00:37,178 --> 00:00:38,178
(Howard:)Yeah.

17
00:00:38,179 --> 00:00:42,149
(Kevin:)Anyway,
I should probably get going.

18
00:00:42,150 --> 00:00:43,520
(Bernadette:)Howie, have you
noticed how often

19
00:00:43,518 --> 00:00:46,248
(Bernadette:)people say that
when you start to do magic?

20
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:49,520
(Josh:)Sorry, I have a long drive.

21
00:00:49,524 --> 00:00:52,324
(Howard:)Well, I hope I get
to see you again.

22
00:00:52,327 --> 00:00:54,027
(chuckles)
I hope so, too.

